{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":502711,"name":"Alexander Hoyos","username":"Alexander_Hoyos","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/e95f7d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-28T14:58:48.927Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502711-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502711-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502711-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502711-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSubject: Urgent: Grok Bot computer unreachable all day – Reset won’t complete (\u003ca href=\"mailto:alexhoyos@ymail.com\"\u003ealexhoyos@ymail.com\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHello Grok Bot Support,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy Grok Bot cloud computer has been unreachable all day, and I can’t recover it from my side. My bots run daily business operations, so this is blocking my work. Please help.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount: \u003ca href=\"mailto:alexhoyos@ymail.com\"\u003ealexhoyos@ymail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nApp version: Grok Bot 0.61.0 (Stable track), macOS\u003cbr\u003e\nAffected bot: AA CARGO BOOKING (all bots share the same computer)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat I’m seeing:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe screen panel shows “Can’t reach AA CARGO BOOKING’s screen.” Retry briefly shows “Starting desktop” and then fails again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe AA CARGO BOOKING agent is stuck on “working.” “Stop AA CARGO BOOKING” is accepted but never takes effect, so “Update Grok Bot’s Computer” stays greyed out.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e“Reset Grok Bot’s Computer” stalls at 50% (“Starting Grok Bot’s computer”), then shows “Taking longer than expected” and never finishes. This has happened repeatedly today.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMy scheduled routines (daily 9:49 AM and 11:59 PM) are failing.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat I’ve already tried, without success:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetry on the screen panel (multiple times)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quitting (Quit Grok Bot) and reopening the app\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStopping the stuck agent\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset Grok Bot’s Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSigning out and signing back in\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChanging my Mac’s DNS to 1.1.1.1 and 8.8.8.8 (I don’t use a VPN)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBased on similar reports in your community forum, it looks like my computer is stuck in a partial state on the backend. Could you please recover it manually? I’ve stopped attempting resets so I don’t interfere with your recovery.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA screenshot of the error screen is attached.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you,\u003cbr\u003e\nAlexander Hoyos\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502711-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502711-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat I’ve already tried, without success:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetry on the screen panel (multiple times)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quitting (Quit Grok Bot) and reopening the app\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStopping the stuck agent\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset Grok Bot’s Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSigning out and signing back in\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChanging my Mac’s DNS to 1.1.1.1 and 8.8.8.8 (I don’t use a VPN)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-502711-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-502711-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/